    "critical_methodological_insight": "In 143 out of 315 positive trials (45.4%), ground truth was set to True solely because a positive audio clip was attached, even though the image contained NO visible person. Consequently, Vision-Only was scored as a False Negative (miss) on frames where there was no visual target to detect. This accounted for 143 of the 208 reported Vision-Only misses (68.75%), artificially depressing Vision-Only recall to 33.97% and exaggerating the perceived gain of multi-modal fusion."
